ing","kernel/unwind/deferred.c::unwind_task_init","kernel/unwind/user.c::unwind_user_next"],"text":"Global mask starts with pending and used set, per-task clear; pending is one bit; setup zeroes, teardown frees cache; each step needs alignment, progress, readable words."},{"sids":["kernel/watchdog.c::get_softlockup_thresh","kernel/watchdog.c::update_cpustat.alt_1","kernel/watchdog_perf.c::watchdog_check_timestamp.alt_1","kernel/watchdog_perf.c::watchdog_overflow_callback"],"text":"Soft limit is twice base spread over windows; utilization keeps capped reduced-precision rings; perf overflows need threshold elapse with bounded rejections, ignored during panic."}],"locks":[{"sids":["kernel/static_call_inline.c::static_call_init","kernel/tracepoint.c::tracepoints_mutex","kernel/tracepoint.c::tracepoint_module_list_mutex"],"text":"Static-call init and module updates hold CPU read outer with static-call lock inner; probe changes use tracepoints mutex; tracker changes use module list mutex."},{"sids":["kernel/unwind/deferred.c::callback_mutex","kernel/tracepoint.c::syscall_regfunc","kernel/watchdog.c::watchdog_mutex","kernel/watchdog.c::__lockup_detector_reconfigure.alt_1"],"text":"Unwind mutation holds its mutex; thread-wide flag updates hold task list shared; watchdog reconfig holds watchdog mutex with inner CPU read."},{"sids":["kernel/watchdog_buddy.c::watchdog_hardlockup_disable","kernel/watchdog_perf.c::hardlockup_detector_perf_stop"],"text":"Buddy refresh orders timestamp before mask via barrier to avoid false reports; perf stop and restart need CPUs held for write over online CPUs."}],"pass":1,"phase_map":[{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p14","crown":"A","phase":"F0"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p04","crown":"A","phase":"F1"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p05","crown":"A","phase":"F4"}],"schema":"lx.dossier.v1","state_machines":[{"sids":["kernel/tracepoint.c::tracepoint_add_func","kernel/tracepoint.c::tracepoint_remove_func","kernel/tracepoint.c::tp_rcu_get_state